                  "CWE-79"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "go.tls.insecure_skip_verify",
              "name": "GoTlsInsecureSkipVerify",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "TLS certificate verification turned off (InsecureSkipVerify: true)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "With InsecureSkipVerify set to true, crypto/tls accepts any certificate the server presents and any host name in it. Anyone who can intercept the connection (on the same network, a hostile proxy, a DNS spoof) can read and change the traffic, including credentials and tokens."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Remove InsecureSkipVerify. For a private or self-signed certificate, add its CA to a CertPool and set RootCAs; for a custom check, keep verification on and add VerifyPeerCertificate or VerifyConnection.",
                "markdown": "**Why:** With InsecureSkipVerify set to true, crypto/tls accepts any certificate the server presents and any host name in it. Anyone who can intercept the connection (on the same network, a hostile proxy, a DNS spoof) can read and change the traffic, including credentials and tokens.\n\n**Fix:** Remove InsecureSkipVerify. For a private or self-signed certificate, add its CA to a CertPool and set RootCAs; for a custom check, keep verification on and add VerifyPeerCertificate or VerifyConnection."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/Ruthvik-Bandari/kestrix/blob/main/docs/modules/code.md#rules",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
