              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Process.Start(), new ProcessStartInfo() and its FileName and Arguments properties start the program they are given with an argument string that the program splits itself. A request value that chooses the program, reaches 'cmd.exe /c' or 'sh -c', or adds to the argument string can run other commands or add options."
